OL,3,ASchools should recognise antisemitism
OL,4,Aas distinct form of harm, review says
OL,5,
OL,6,FSchools and colleges in England will be
OL,7,Frequired to recognise antisemitism as a
OL,8,Fdistinct category of harm and take
OL,9,Fexplicit action against it following a
OL,10,Fmajor review, the BBC understands.
OL,12,FIt means anti-Jewish hatred would be
OL,13,Ftreated as a specific safeguarding risk
OL,14,Frather than being dealt with through
OL,15,Fexisting measures to stop racism and
OL,16,Fbullying.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
