OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASchools should recognise antisemitism
OL,4,Aas distinct form of harm, review says
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government-commissioned review into
OL,7,Fantisemitism in education is also
OL,8,Fexpected to recommend dedicated
OL,9,Ftraining for teachers, more consistent
OL,10,Frecording and reporting of incidents,
OL,11,Fand better education about antisemitism
OL,12,Fand modern-day Jewish life.
OL,14,FThe BBC understands it will also call
OL,15,Ffor stronger guidance on political
OL,16,Fimpartiality for teachers.
